 .
 Sign in to OpenRouter from the browser: /login opens the approval
 page, you confirm with your account and the key comes back - no
 copying keys by hand. Or paste your own key for DeepSeek, OpenAI,
 Moonshot, xAI, Qwen, Z.ai, Groq, Mistral, Together, a local
 Ollama / llama.cpp, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint.
 .
